      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "They share their progress.",
      "translation": "Eles compartilham seu progresso.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9910_1775804220496.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009911",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "They agree on next steps.",
      "translation": "Eles concordam com os próximos passos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9911_1775804307849.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009912",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I send an email.",
      "translation": "Eu envio um e-mail.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9912_1775804308029.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009913",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I reply quickly.",
      "translation": "Eu respondo rapidamente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9913_1775804308194.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009914",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I forward the message.",
      "translation": "Eu encaminho a mensagem.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9914_1775804310448.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009915",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I attach a document.",
      "translation": "Eu anexo um documento.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9915_1775804310640.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009916",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I schedule a call.",
      "translation": "Eu agendo uma chamada.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9916_1775804310793.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009917",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I confirm the details.",
      "translation": "Eu confirmo os detalhes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9917_1775804310965.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009918",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "You check your inbox.",
      "translation": "Você verifica sua caixa de entrada.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9918_1775804311401.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009919",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "You respond to clients.",
      "translation": "Você responde aos clientes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9919_1775804313798.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009920",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "He writes formal emails.",
      "translation": "Ele escreve e-mails formais.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9920_1775804314002.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009921",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "She sends updates daily.",
      "translation": "Ela envia atualizações diariamente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9921_1775804368577.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009922",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "We communicate by email.",
      "translation": "Nós nos comunicamos por e-mail.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9922_1775804368753.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009923",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "They prefer quick messages.",
      "translation": "Eles preferem mensagens rápidas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9923_1775804368959.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009924",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I leave the office at six.",
      "translation": "Eu saio do escritório às seis.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9924_1775804369223.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009925",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I finish my tasks.",
      "translation": "Eu termino minhas tarefas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9925_1775804369383.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009926",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I shut down my computer.",
      "translation": "Eu desligo o meu computador.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9926_1775804371824.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009927",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I prepare for tomorrow.",
      "translation": "Eu me preparo para amanhã.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9927_1775804372007.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009928",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "You leave after work.",
      "translation": "Você sai depois do trabalho.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9928_1775804374447.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009929",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "He finishes his shift.",
      "translation": "Ele termina o turno dele.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9929_1775804374636.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009930",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "She completes her tasks.",
      "translation": "Ela conclui suas tarefas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9930_1775804374807.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009931",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "We wrap up the day.",
      "translation": "Nós encerramos o dia.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9931_1775804410873.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009932",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "They prepare for the next day.",
      "translation": "Eles se preparam para o dia seguinte.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9932_1775804411068.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009933",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Can you take a look at this?",
      "translation": "Você pode dar uma olhada nisso?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9933_1775804411398.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009934",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Can you help me with this task?",
      "translation": "Você pode me ajudar com esta tarefa?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9934_1775804411600.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009935",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Can you clarify this point?",
      "translation": "Você pode esclarecer este ponto?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9935_1775804411793.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009936",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Can you explain that again?",
      "translation": "Você pode explicar isso de novo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9936_1775804414330.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009937",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Could you send me the file?",
      "translation": "Você poderia me enviar o arquivo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9937_1775804416720.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009938",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Could you share the link?",
      "translation": "Você poderia compartilhar o link?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9938_1775804416921.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009939",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Could you update the document?",
      "translation": "Você poderia atualizar o documento?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9939_1775804417177.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009940",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Could you confirm the deadline?",
      "translation": "Você poderia confirmar o prazo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9940_1775804417377.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009941",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Could you check these numbers?",
      "translation": "Você poderia verificar estes números?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9941_1775804492394.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009942",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "Could you review this quickly?",
      "translation": "Você poderia revisar isso rapidamente?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9942_1775804496929.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009943",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will send the file now.",
      "translation": "Eu vou enviar o arquivo agora.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9943_1775804500812.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009944",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will share the document.",
      "translation": "Eu vou compartilhar o documento.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9944_1775804503811.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009945",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will update this today.",
      "translation": "Eu vou atualizar isso hoje.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9945_1775804509714.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009946",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will finish it later.",
      "translation": "Eu vou terminar isso mais tarde.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9946_1775804512726.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009947",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will check and confirm.",
      "translation": "Eu vou verificar e confirmar.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9947_1775804517399.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009948",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will get back to you soon.",
      "translation": "Eu entrarei em contato com você em breve.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: At the Office",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/en-US/251_9948_1775804521946.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000009949",
      "language_id": "en",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000251",
      "text": "I will follow up tomorrow.",
