      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: 300 Questions & Answers - Part 1",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/300_12463_1778485553628.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000012464",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000300",
      "text": "¿Cómo vas al trabajo o a la escuela?",
      "translation": "Como você vai para o trabalho ou para a escola?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: 300 Questions & Answers - Part 1",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/300_12464_1778485553803.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000012465",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000300",
      "text": "Voy al trabajo en autobús.",
      "translation": "Eu vou para o trabalho de ônibus.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: 300 Questions & Answers - Part 1",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/300_12465_1778485554033.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000012466",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000300",
      "text": "¿A qué hora empiezas a trabajar?",
