      "text": "Él responde a las llamadas telefónicas.",
      "translation": "Ele opera sistemas de reserva.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10301_1778567529030.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010302",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Él maneja los sistemas de reserva.",
      "translation": "Ele resolve problemas dos clientes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10302_1778567529342.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010303",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Él resuelve los problemas de los clientes.",
      "translation": "Ela trabalha como garçonete.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10303_1778567529647.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010304",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella trabaja como camarera.",
      "translation": "Ela atende clientes diariamente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10304_1778567529933.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010305",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella atiende a los clientes a diario.",
      "translation": "Ela anota os pedidos rapidamente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10305_1778567530327.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010306",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella toma los pedidos rápidamente.",
      "translation": "Ela recomenda pratos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10306_1778567530693.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010307",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella recomienda platos.",
      "translation": "Ela garante uma boa experiência.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10307_1778567530988.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010308",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella garantiza una buena experiencia.",
      "translation": "Eles trabalham na limpeza.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10308_1778567531375.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010309",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos trabajan en el servicio de limpieza.",
      "translation": "Eles limpam os quartos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10309_1778567531668.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010310",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos limpian las habitaciones.",
      "translation": "Eles preparam as áreas dos hóspedes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10310_1778567531944.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010311",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos preparan las zonas para huéspedes.",
      "translation": "Eles repõem os suprimentos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10311_1778567532264.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010312",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos reponen los suministros.",
      "translation": "Eles mantêm altos padrões.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10312_1778567532662.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010313",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos mantienen altos estándares.",
      "translation": "Nós trabalhamos como uma equipe.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10313_1778567532955.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010314",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Trabajamos en equipo.",
      "translation": "Nós apoiamos uns aos outros.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10314_1778567533250.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010315",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Nos apoyamos mutuamente.",
      "translation": "Nós lidamos com horas de movimento juntos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10315_1778567533607.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010316",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Gestionamos las horas punta juntos.",
      "translation": "Nós nos comunicamos constantemente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10316_1778567533913.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010317",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Nos comunicamos constantemente.",
      "translation": "Nós garantimos um serviço sem problemas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10317_1778567534175.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010318",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Garantizamos un servicio fluido.",
      "translation": "O hotel está totalmente lotado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10318_1778567534446.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010319",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El hotel está completo.",
      "translation": "O restaurante está movimentado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10319_1778567534724.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010320",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El restaurante está lleno.",
      "translation": "Os hóspedes estão chegando.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10320_1778568894745.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010321",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Los huéspedes están llegando.",
      "translation": "O serviço está correndo bem.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10321_1778568895090.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010322",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El servicio funciona bien.",
      "translation": "A atmosfera é acolhedora.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10322_1778568895390.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010323",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El ambiente es acogedor.",
      "translation": "O cliente precisa de assistência.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10323_1778568895634.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010324",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El cliente necesita asistencia.",
      "translation": "O hóspede tem um pedido.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10324_1778568895912.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010325",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El huésped tiene una petición.",
      "translation": "O quarto está pronto.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10325_1778568896282.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010326",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La habitación está lista.",
      "translation": "A mesa está reservada.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10326_1778568896586.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010327",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La mesa está reservada.",
      "translation": "O pedido está preparado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10327_1778568896835.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010328",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "El pedido está preparado.",
      "translation": "Eu lidei com um hóspede difícil.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10328_1778568897102.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010329",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Atendí a un huésped difícil.",
      "translation": "Eu resolvi um problema de reserva.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10329_1778568897426.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010330",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Resolví un problema de reserva.",
      "translation": "Eu ajudei um cliente rapidamente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10330_1778568897693.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010331",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ayudé a un cliente rápidamente.",
      "translation": "Eu gerenciei um turno agitado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10331_1778568897951.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010332",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Gestioné un turno ajetreado.",
      "translation": "Ele lidou com uma reclamação.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10332_1778568898238.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010333",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Él gestionó una queja.",
      "translation": "Ela resolveu o problema.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10333_1778568898521.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010334",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella resolvió el problema.",
      "translation": "Eles consertaram o erro.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10334_1778568898815.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010335",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos corrigieron el error.",
      "translation": "Nós melhoramos o serviço.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10335_1778568899124.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010336",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Mejoramos el servicio.",
      "translation": "Eu estou me preparando para o turno da noite.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10336_1778568899396.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010337",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Me estoy preparando para el turno de tarde.",
      "translation": "Eu estou verificando as reservas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10337_1778568899696.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010338",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Estoy revisando las reservas.",
      "translation": "Eu estou organizando o espaço de trabalho.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10338_1778568900092.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010339",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Estoy organizando el espacio de trabajo.",
      "translation": "Eu estou ajudando hóspedes agora.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10339_1778568900359.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010340",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Estoy ayudando a los huéspedes ahora.",
      "translation": "Ele está auxiliando clientes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10340_1778568900629.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010341",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Él está asistiendo a los clientes.",
      "translation": "Ela está servindo mesas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10341_1778568900929.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010342",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella está atendiendo las mesas.",
      "translation": "Eles estão preparando quartos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10342_1778568901193.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010343",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos están preparando las habitaciones.",
      "translation": "Nós estamos lidando com um período de muito movimento.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10343_1778568901445.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010344",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Estamos gestionando un periodo de mucha actividad.",
      "translation": "Eu vou gerenciar o próximo turno.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10344_1778568901787.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010345",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Gestionaré el próximo turno.",
      "translation": "Eu vou receber novos hóspedes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10345_1778568902116.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010346",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Daré la bienvenida a los nuevos huéspedes.",
      "translation": "Eu vou preparar as mesas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10346_1778568902409.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010347",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Prepararé las mesas.",
      "translation": "Eu vou apoiar a equipe.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10347_1778568902802.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010348",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Apoyaré al equipo.",
      "translation": "Ele cuidará das reservas.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10348_1778568903118.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010349",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Él gestionará las reservas.",
      "translation": "Ela servirá os clientes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10349_1778568903426.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010350",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ella atenderá a los clientes.",
      "translation": "Eles prepararão os quartos.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10350_1778569871243.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010351",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Ellos prepararán las habitaciones.",
      "translation": "Nós garantiremos que tudo corra bem.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10351_1778569871637.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010352",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Nos aseguraremos de que todo funcione correctamente.",
      "translation": "Você cuidou da reserva?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10352_1778569872015.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010353",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Gestionaste la reserva?",
      "translation": "Ele resolveu o problema?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10353_1778569872319.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010354",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Resolvió él el problema?",
      "translation": "Ela ajudou o hóspede?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10354_1778569872696.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010355",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Asistió ella al huésped?",
      "translation": "Eles prepararam o quarto?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10355_1778569873022.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010356",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Prepararon ellos la habitación?",
      "translation": "Como você lida com reclamações?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10356_1778569873385.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010357",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cómo gestionas las quejas?",
      "translation": "Como você gerencia as horas de movimento?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10357_1778569873759.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010358",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cómo gestionas las horas punta?",
      "translation": "Como você mantém os clientes satisfeitos?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10358_1778569874018.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010359",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cómo mantienes satisfechos a los clientes?",
      "translation": "Como você melhora o serviço?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10359_1778569874293.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010360",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cómo mejoras el servicio?",
      "translation": "Por que o hóspede reclamou?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10360_1778569874612.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010361",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Por qué se quejó el huésped?",
      "translation": "Por que o serviço atrasou?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10361_1778569874883.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010362",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Por qué se retrasó el servicio?",
      "translation": "Por que o quarto não estava pronto?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10362_1778569875162.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010363",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Por qué no estaba lista la habitación?",
      "translation": "Por que o cliente foi embora cedo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10363_1778569875421.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010364",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Por qué se fue el cliente temprano?",
      "translation": "O hotel estará lotado hoje à noite?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10364_1778569875675.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010365",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Estará el hotel lleno esta noche?",
      "translation": "O restaurante estará movimentado?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10365_1778569875970.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010366",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Estará el restaurante lleno?",
      "translation": "Novos hóspedes chegarão em breve?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10366_1778569876255.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010367",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Llegarán pronto nuevos huéspedes?",
      "translation": "A equipe vai dar conta do movimento?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10367_1778569876643.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010368",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Podrá el equipo gestionar las horas punta?",
      "translation": "Hospitalidade exige paciência.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10368_1778569876912.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010369",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La hostelería requiere paciencia.",
      "translation": "Hospitalidade exige profissionalismo.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10369_1778569877195.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010370",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La hostelería requiere profesionalidad.",
      "translation": "Hospitalidade exige atenção aos detalhes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10370_1778569877535.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010371",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La hostelería requiere atención al detalle.",
      "translation": "Hospitalidade exige trabalho em equipe.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10371_1778569877835.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010372",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La hostelería requiere trabajo en equipo.",
      "translation": "Um bom serviço gera fidelidade.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10372_1778569878124.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010373",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Un buen servicio genera lealtad.",
      "translation": "Um bom serviço cria confiança.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10373_1778569878432.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010374",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Un buen servicio crea confianza.",
      "translation": "Um bom serviço melhora a reputação.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10374_1778569878697.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010375",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Un buen servicio mejora la reputación.",
      "translation": "A experiência do cliente é essencial.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10375_1778569878961.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010376",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "La experiencia del cliente es esencial.",
      "translation": "Bem-vindo, sua mesa está pronta.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10376_1778569879241.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010377",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Bienvenido, su mesa está lista.",
      "translation": "Seu quarto está pronto.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10377_1778569879517.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010378",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Su habitación está lista.",
      "translation": "Deixe-me ajudá-lo com isso.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10378_1778569879806.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010379",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Permítame ayudarle con eso.",
      "translation": "Vou ajudá-lo imediatamente.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10379_1778569880070.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010380",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Le asistiré enseguida.",
      "translation": "Por favor, siga-me.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10380_1778570219421.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010381",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Por favor, sígame.",
      "translation": "Por favor, aguarde um momento.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10381_1778570219735.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010382",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Por favor, espere un momento.",
      "translation": "Obrigado pela sua paciência.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10382_1778570220061.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010383",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Gracias por su paciencia.",
      "translation": "Você tem uma reserva?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10383_1778570220421.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010384",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Tiene una reserva?",
      "translation": "Poderia me dizer seu nome, por favor?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10384_1778570220721.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010385",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Me puede dar su nombre, por favor?",
      "translation": "Quantas pessoas estão com você?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10385_1778570221196.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010386",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cuántas personas vienen con usted?",
      "translation": "Para que horas é sua reserva?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10386_1778570221508.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010387",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿A qué hora es su reserva?",
      "translation": "Quanto tempo você vai ficar?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10387_1778570221990.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010388",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cuánto tiempo se quedará?",
      "translation": "Aqui está sua chave.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10388_1778570222448.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010389",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Aquí tiene su llave.",
      "translation": "Aqui está seu cardápio.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10389_1778570222815.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010390",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Aquí tiene el menú.",
      "translation": "Aqui está seu recibo.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10390_1778570223132.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010391",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Aquí tiene su recibo.",
      "translation": "Aqui está a informação que você solicitou.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10391_1778570223454.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010392",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Aquí tiene la información que solicitó.",
      "translation": "Deixe-me verificar isso para você.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10392_1778570223835.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010393",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Permítame comprobar eso por usted.",
      "translation": "Vou confirmar sua reserva.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10393_1778570224311.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010394",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Confirmaré su reserva.",
      "translation": "Vou preparar sua mesa.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10394_1778570224582.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010395",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Prepararé su mesa.",
      "translation": "Vou organizar isso agora.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10395_1778570224886.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010396",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Organizaré eso ahora mismo.",
      "translation": "Vou chamar alguém para ajudar.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10396_1778570225186.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010397",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Llamaré a alguien para que le ayude.",
      "translation": "Você gostaria de uma mesa dentro ou fora?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10397_1778570225460.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010398",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Le gustaría una mesa dentro o fuera?",
      "translation": "Gostaria de algo para beber?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10398_1778570225809.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010399",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Le gustaría algo de beber?",
      "translation": "Gostaria de ver o cardápio?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10399_1778570226089.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010400",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Le gustaría ver la carta?",
      "translation": "Gostaria de alguma recomendação?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10400_1778570226332.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010401",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Desea alguna recomendación?",
      "translation": "Gostaria de sobremesa?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10401_1778570226661.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010402",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Desea postre?",
      "translation": "Você está pronto para pedir?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10402_1778570226918.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010403",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Están listos para pedir?",
      "translation": "Você precisa de mais tempo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10403_1778570227199.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010404",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Necesitan más tiempo?",
      "translation": "O que você gostaria hoje?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10404_1778570227453.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010405",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Qué le gustaría hoy?",
      "translation": "Como você gostaria que fosse cozido?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10405_1778570227738.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010406",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Cómo le gustaría que se cocinara?",
      "translation": "Posso trazer mais alguma coisa?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10406_1778570228092.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010407",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Puedo traerle algo más?",
      "translation": "Posso lhe trazer outra bebida?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10407_1778570228416.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010408",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Puedo traerle otra bebida?",
      "translation": "Posso limpar a mesa?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10408_1778570229010.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010409",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Puedo recoger la mesa?",
      "translation": "Posso retirar seu prato?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10409_1778570229306.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010410",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Puedo llevarme su plato?",
      "translation": "Está tudo bem?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10410_1778570413928.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010411",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Está todo bien?",
      "translation": "Está tudo ao seu gosto?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10411_1778570414253.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010412",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Está todo a su gusto?",
      "translation": "O quarto está confortável?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10412_1778570414531.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010413",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Es cómoda la habitación?",
      "translation": "Há algo que você precise?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10413_1778570414875.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010414",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "¿Hay algo más que necesite?",
      "translation": "Seu pedido chegará em breve.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10414_1778570415138.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010415",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Su pedido llegará pronto.",
      "translation": "Seu quarto estará pronto em instantes.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10415_1778570415395.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010416",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Su habitación estará lista en breve.",
      "translation": "Seu táxi está a caminho.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10416_1778570412973.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010417",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Su taxi está en camino.",
      "translation": "Sua solicitação está sendo atendida.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/254_10417_1778570415678.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000010418",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000254",
      "text": "Estamos gestionando su petición.",
      "translation": "O café da manhã é servido das sete às dez.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: Hospitality Industry",
      "difficulty": "easy",
