      "text": "¿Puedo cargar mi móvil aquí?",
      "translation": "Posso carregar meu celular aqui?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15490_1778573541909.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015491",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Hay algún enchufe?",
      "translation": "Tem uma tomada?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15491_1778573542216.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015492",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Estoy esperando a un amigo.",
      "translation": "Estou esperando um amigo.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15492_1778573542532.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015493",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Me trae la cuenta, por favor?",
      "translation": "Pode me trazer a conta, por favor?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15493_1778573542803.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015494",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "La cuenta, por favor.",
      "translation": "A conta, por favor.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15494_1778573543036.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015495",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Puedo pagar con tarjeta?",
      "translation": "Posso pagar com cartão?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15495_1778573543277.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015496",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Aceptan efectivo?",
      "translation": "Vocês aceitam dinheiro?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15496_1778573543595.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015497",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Está incluido el servicio?",
      "translation": "O serviço está incluído?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15497_1778573543841.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015498",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Quédese con la vuelta.",
      "translation": "Fique com o troco.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15498_1778573544082.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015499",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Me da el tique?",
      "translation": "Pode me dar um recibo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15499_1778573544361.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015500",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Para llevar, por favor.",
      "translation": "Para levar, por favor.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15500_1778573598668.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015501",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Para tomar aquí, por favor.",
      "translation": "Para comer aqui, por favor.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15501_1778573599060.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015502",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Un vaso para llevar, por favor.",
      "translation": "Um copo descartável, por favor.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15502_1778573599311.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015503",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Puede poner esto en una bolsa?",
      "translation": "Pode colocar isso em uma sacola?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15503_1778573599596.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015504",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Todo estaba muy bien.",
      "translation": "Estava tudo ótimo.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15504_1778573599975.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015505",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Muchas gracias.",
      "translation": "Muito obrigado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15505_1778573600365.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015506",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Que tenga un buen día.",
      "translation": "Tenha um bom dia.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15506_1778573600646.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015507",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Hasta mañana.",
      "translation": "Até amanhã.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15507_1778573607034.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015508",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Querría otro, por favor.",
      "translation": "Eu gostaria de outro, por favor.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15508_1778573607311.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015509",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Uno más, por favor.",
      "translation": "Mais um, por favor.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15509_1778573607575.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015510",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Solo la cuenta, gracias.",
      "translation": "Apenas a conta, obrigado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15510_1778573607905.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015511",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Podemos pagar por separado?",
      "translation": "Podemos pagar separadamente?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15511_1778573608225.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015512",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Yo pagaré todo.",
      "translation": "Eu vou pagar tudo.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15512_1778573608634.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015513",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Está abierta la cocina?",
      "translation": "A cozinha está aberta?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15513_1778573608952.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015514",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Sirven desayunos todo el día?",
      "translation": "Vocês servem café da manhã o dia todo?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15514_1778573609252.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015515",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿A qué hora cierran?",
      "translation": "A que horas vocês fecham?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15515_1778573609567.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015516",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Abren los domingos?",
      "translation": "Vocês abrem aos domingos?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15516_1778573609896.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015517",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Puedo sentarme al lado de la ventana?",
      "translation": "Posso me sentar perto da janela?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15517_1778573610187.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015518",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Hay demasiado ruido aquí.",
      "translation": "Está muito barulhento aqui.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15518_1778573610439.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015519",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Puede bajar la música?",
      "translation": "Pode baixar a música?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15519_1778573610728.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015520",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Hace un poco de frío aquí dentro.",
      "translation": "Está um pouco frio aqui.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15520_1778573610991.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015521",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Hay terraza?",
      "translation": "Tem um terraço?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15521_1778573611217.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015522",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Tienen zona de fumadores?",
      "translation": "Você tem uma área para fumantes?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15522_1778573611503.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015523",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Querría un café descafeinado.",
      "translation": "Eu gostaria de um café descafeinado.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15523_1778573611776.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015524",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Tienen miel para el té?",
      "translation": "Você tem mel para o chá?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15524_1778573612041.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015525",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Me pone un poco de hielo, por favor?",
      "translation": "Pode me dar um pouco de gelo, por favor?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15525_1778573612454.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015526",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Esto está demasiado dulce.",
      "translation": "Isto está muito doce.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15526_1778573612693.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015527",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Esto está demasiado fuerte.",
      "translation": "Isto está muito forte.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15527_1778573612946.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015528",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "Me gusta el ambiente de aquí.",
      "translation": "Gosto do ambiente aqui.",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15528_1778573613280.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p1f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000015529",
      "language_id": "es",
      "category_id": "c8f13e77-9dfc-4b55-a0bc-000000000266",
      "text": "¿Tienen un plato del día?",
      "translation": "Você tem um prato do dia?",
      "explanation": "Frase da coleção: In the café",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "audio_url": "https://audio.hyperlingua.app/audio/ae/gc/es-ES/266_15529_1778573613559.mp3",
      "voice_name": "Fenrir",
      "speed": 1
    },
    {
